cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this version and the original scientific works relevant to your study."
type: software
title: "BioInformaticsHarness: guidance and evidence tools for biological model research"
version: 0.1.0-alpha.2
date-released: "2026-10-22"
authors:
  - name: "BioInformaticsHarness contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/vvcchh0/BioInformaticsHarness"
license:
  - Apache-2.0
  - CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  A research prototype checkpoint with conditional method guidance, artifact
  and handoff tools, first-plan sealing, pre-execution code capture, and
  CPU examples that consume saved states on open UCI data. Code, prose,
  data, and trained parameter artifacts have explicit separate scopes
  described in LICENSING.md. Full private research archives are not distributed.
keywords:
  - bioinformatics
  - research methodology
  - reproducibility
  - research software
  - provenance
